      "prompt_sha1": "0019eab6534968d38261406a88d4d2f32266bb8c",
      "answer": "GPT-4 was fine-tuned using supervised learning (SFT) with demonstration data to imitate desired behavior [D3]. Additionally, a reward model (RM) was trained using ranking data to predict labeler preferences, which was then used to fine-tune the SFT model with reinforcement learning (specifically, the PPO algorithm) [D3]. The fine-tuning process also involved human feedback and AI-driven reinforcement learning to enhance alignment with human ethical standards and policy compliance [W2]. The post-training alignment process improved performance on measures of factuality and adherence to desired behavior [D4].",
