      "answer": "The difference between GPT-4-early and GPT-4-launch is that GPT-4-early is an early version fine-tuned for instruction following, while GPT-4-launch is a version fine-tuned for increased helpfulness and harmlessness with additional safety mitigations applied [D3][W1]. GPT-4-launch exhibits much safer behavior due to these mitigations, whereas GPT-4-early reflects the risks of GPT-4 when minimal safety mitigations are applied [D3][W1].",
